From 9474004bdbdf9b21c0d83fdeaaa4b592ec617e0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 06:27:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/22] plugins: accept Host API 3 pixel plugin manifests;
 per-plugin data directory

Accept protocol 3 manifests whose min_host_api matches, requiring the
display, touch-input and pixel-surface permissions and allowing
gpu-acceleration, network and audio-output. Add IsPixel() and the data
directory used by the launcher; removing a plugin removes its data.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J6XhHxrkhAcXmkzHMeCnVz
---
 aeraui/features/plugins/plugin_manager.cpp | 66 ++++++++++++++++++++--
 aeraui/features/plugins/plugin_manager.hpp | 10 +++-
 2 files changed, 70 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

